When they run into responsive sellers, those sellers, as prices move higher, will eventually turn into initiative sellers.

60
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:14,700
That initiative then forces prices lower and eventually buyers stop initiating and they then turn to responsive buyers at lower prices again.

61
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:16,900
